"""The curated trait and notable-variant panel.

Every allele here is on the forward (plus) strand of GRCh38, the strand the
sample's calls are on. 'eur' is the effect allele's approximate frequency in
Europeans; step 8 checks it against 1000 Genomes and stops on a mismatch,
the guard against the classic strand mistake (an allele given on the gene's
strand for a gene on the minus strand).

model: 'dom'   one copy is enough for the effect
       'add'   each copy adds
       'rec'   the effect needs two copies
       a name  computed by a function in 08_traits.py (apoe, abo, mc1r)
texts: what 0, 1 and 2 copies of the effect allele mean (hemizygous X: 0/1)."""

